Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare up, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature, it's a slime, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that slimes were limited to\Nthe realm of fantasy, but apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I read a book about a slime, and\Nit looked just like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The book was quite fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This slime you see loved\Nto attack beautiful women.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Its body fluids were harmless, but\Nthey had a knack for melting clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:02:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster is pretty messed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, by the way, can I borrow that book?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I borrow it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If that thing touches you, it's going to\Ndo a lot worse than just melt your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The fish are dying from the little pieces\Nof itself that dropped in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing's made of poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It only takes a drop to kill,\Nand it looks like it's spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but the samurai's\Ntorso is in that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not. You're diving in, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought him with us, so\NI can't let him die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be a woman right now,\Nbut it's time to man up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Handle the ones behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be too long. Huh? Behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A veritable puffy of many slimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you think in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I'm the strongest\Nswimmer on the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll be done before anything\Nhappens to your gorgeous body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is even colder than it looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I better make this quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, the Master's not here. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably outside to watch the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That degenerate can't get\Nenough death and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be taking off soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be lonely without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use your help with\Nsomething first, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I borrow you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? A date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A man of few words, are we? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was bored anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the bird Lady\NUsopp was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat caught the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Little punk, how dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar has Logia powers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But Luffy can still grab him\Neven though he's made of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:05:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soothe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you jerks want to pick a\Nfight, then pick one with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar can't use his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With Armament Haki, Luffy\Nis able to touch Caesar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,even though he has Logia powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However, unlike ocean\Nwater or sea prism stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't actually weaken\Nthe person that he touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know the full extent\Nof the Gas-Gasfruit's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gas robe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just suck it up and\Ndie already, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've performed countless experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can assure you that\Nmy gas will subject you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to only the most exquisite of suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joe, he's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sucking up all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's screwed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess poison doesn't\Nbother me too much anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because of Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The prison guard with\Nthe parimethia powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My poison's potency makes his look puny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, gong gong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you lay\Nanother finger on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business,\Nyou maggots! Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't just call us maggots, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have heard him wrong. Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunfire! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And Dasta Net!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've had enough fun for\Ntoday, wake up my smileys, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Smileys? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're moving. How do they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good. Now give Straw\NHat a big hug, go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They can follow orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they were just goop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those slime guys blow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, woo-wee! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gastonet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Conjecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Those slimy dudes blow up like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting us all worked up over nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Muffy's got this in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that kid's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let him handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta fight us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got you for\Nreal this time! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything here I can put him in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got Logia power,\Nso we can't tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, like a barrel or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is taking him\Ninto custody, so step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well turn\Nyourself in while you're at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up, pirate scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we fight the Straw Hats or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the boss doesn't\Nknow what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I had hoped you were smarter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you, we don't\Ntrust this Caesar character either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy is shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the boss sent an\Nundercover agent to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The lovely monet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it, you're a warlord now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was spending some time in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hitched a ride on a S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,tanker leaving port And now, it\Nseems that was the right move
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why target me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do a damn thing to you No,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,not yet anyway Because if you had,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd be dead right now I\Nhate to break it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no fooling us grown-ups. Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I\Nshould just finish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that's Smoker, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I never thought I'd see the Vice\NAdmiral get knocked out twice in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not the only one who went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Three of the Straw Hats did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Think the Master used conquerors, Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could be\Nthat much stronger than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he beat all of them without\Neven laying a finger on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fun while it lasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what you get maybe you should\Nhave known better than to mess with the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,master he is our god of salvation master
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,master master master
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,master master now we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,mustn't waste any time my strong soldiers\Nhurry and tie these five pirate scoundrels
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Up at once, you see prism stone shackles\Non the power holders. Once you're done, I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,want you to move out leave the sailors\Nbehind and seek refuge inside the lab it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,far too dangerous out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,here i'm sure you've
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,all noticed the strange substance that's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,been raining down from the sky there's\Nno cause for concern i will ensure your
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,safety okay thank you master it seems the\Nyeti cool brothers failed at their task
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I can't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the combination of Straw Hat and\NLaw was simply too much for them to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any eyes. Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm immune to your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fight me to let in this villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we can't use our\Nswords against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They spit poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you go and poke the damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what it did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that maybe it\Njust didn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They're made of jelly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should try eating one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd stop bullying me\Ninto things like this, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nearly 70 years older than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, sorry I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't just call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no Grandpa, I'm a lively skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the slime's venom or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping the torso is not stuck\Nin the middle of that poisonous cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been using observation Haki for a\Nwhile now and I haven't found anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be getting weak;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell the difference\Nbetween its life force
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fish that are\Nswimming around a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling all right, Mr. Samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you're in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop chewing on it, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't hurt, it merely itches a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what's gotten into this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be dreadful to sound like those.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe something happened to Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of it or else, shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the last piece\Nof the samurai puzzle now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we can put the poor bastard\Nback together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hurry and get the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's closing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison already got this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what'll I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Nami's body strong enough\Nto get me out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not looking good for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole lake is turning\Nthe color of the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd better hurry and come ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't close up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it out alive! Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's got the torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you said he would!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feared I would never have\Nmy body back as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to you, I'm a\Nwhole samurai once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I must admit, you're a lot\Ntaller than I expected you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even taller than me, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I am the samurai Kidamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hailed from a town called Kuri, in\Nthe land of Wano, if you're not aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can somebody help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That coat's going to disappear\Nonce he takes it off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall I call you, curly eyebrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know your\Nhonorable name, my good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, my name is Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the sir crap, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you get your body back and all\Nof a sudden you start acting like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I put my neck out to help you\Nwhen you were just a severed head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead of being appreciative,\Nyou kept hurling insults at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had known sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I loathe pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That does explain your barbarism.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on my last nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to say is\Nhelp me find my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking for help from you,\Npirates, I would rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure you must pity\Na poor disembodied head
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,who can't even defend\Nhimself if someone attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So would you like to carry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a horrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.62,0:23:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I insulted you and your\Nfriends, yet you rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubted you when you swore\Nto make me whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I wasn't convinced until it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.14,0:23:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.28,0:23:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm backing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.18,0:23:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lift your head, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No man should ever get\Ndown on his knees and beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:24:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking,\Nwithout you, I would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I hate to interrupt\Nthis touching moment, I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it would appear that\Nwe're in mortal danger right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to our colorful friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.00,0:24:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all the slime guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to\Ndo something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.74,0:24:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well we tried and didn't work, so we\Njust gave up—what were we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You chump, shouldn't\Nhave given up so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.56,0:24:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know that Nami would kill me if\Nanything were to happen to this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are never gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,give it back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.46,0:24:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you, nope?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.37,0:24:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:24:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may make a suggestion—why don't\Nwe try to destroy it with fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.44,0:24:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, see my blade—it burns as it cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I am known as Fox Fire. Keen?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Em on allow me to blaze a\Npath so that we may escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can burn and...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,can burn and Slice enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.96,0:25:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds a lot like magic if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.46,0:26:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut through it? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've cleared our path of the slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were engulfed by the\Nfire from that massive explosion,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.94,0:26:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, if you wouldn't mind,\Ncould you explain what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut through the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And how'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My foxfire-style slices with flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And through the knowledge and\Nuse of my myriad of secret arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.20,0:26:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am able to cut through flame as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no fire that can\Nwithstand my blade. None.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.04,0:26:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Momonosuke is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.52,0:26:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go and rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.18,0:26:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.88,0:26:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to\Nsee a samurai in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.62,0:27:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, Kin'emon,\NI'll help you save your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.68,0:27:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You
